{"id":"622281","name":"萝卜烫面包","author":"hndhkhb","authorId":"2115673","desc":"","cover":"images/622281/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"3个"},{"name":"肉馅","amount":"1斤"},{"name":"肉丁","amount":"250g"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"400g"},{"name":"海米","amount":"50g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"大葱","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"少许"},{"name":"皮冻","amount":"200g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉1000g放入盆中；","img":"images/622281/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"温水和成面团；","img":"images/622281/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面团揉光滑；","img":"images/622281/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗净擦丝焯水稍微剁一下的萝卜；","img":"images/622281/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅好的肉馅和切好的肉丁；","img":"images/622281/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切好的葱花；","img":"images/622281/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"姜末；","img":"images/622281/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切好的皮冻；","img":"images/622281/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切好的香菇丁；","img":"images/622281/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"泡好的海米；","img":"images/622281/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"肉馅肉丁用味极鲜喂好；","img":"images/622281/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"所有蔬菜放一起；","img":"images/622281/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加盐味精拌均匀；","img":"images/622281/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"皮冻肉馅肉丁放入，加花生油香油最后调味；","img":"images/622281/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"包好的包子；","img":"images/622281/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"蒸好的包子。","img":"images/622281/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"和面的时候不能用冷水，用温水或半烫面；放肉馅好包，放肉丁有咬劲儿；放皮冻包的时候好包，吃的时候好吃——一包汤——再一顿吃还是一包汤。\n还有一些细节，包的时候捏的褶子不能太厚，蒸的时间不能太长。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}